lly mounting via screws, standoffs, etc.\n\nNote: Use the keepout ring to avoid running the screw head into surrounding components. Variant Overviews\n\n• STAND-OFF - Mechanical footprint for a #4 phillips button head screw.\n• STAND-OFF-TIGHT - Mechanical footprint for a #4 phillips button head screw,\n\nExample SparkFun Products\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10453 Screw - Phillips Head (1/4\", 4-40, 10 pack) (PRT-10453)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10452 Screw - Phillips Head (1/2\", 4-40, 10 pack) (PRT-10452)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10451 Screw - Phillips Head (3/4\", 4-40, 10 pack) (PRT-10451)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10450 Screw - Phillips Head (1\", 4-40, 10 pack) (PRT-10450)" (at 0 0 0) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "ki_locked" "" (at 0 0 0) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (symbol "STAND-OFFTIGHT_0_0" (circle (center 0 0) (radius 1.27) (stroke (width 0.254) (type solid)) (fill (type none)))) (symbol "STAND-OFFTIGHT_1_1") (embedded_fonts no)) (symbol "kicad_file-eagle-import:TEST-POINT3X4" (exclude_from_sim no) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (in_pos_files yes) (duplicate_pin_numbers_are_jumpers no) (property "Reference" "TP" (at -2.54 2.54 0) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom))) (property "Value" "" (at -2.54 -2.54 0) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom))) (property "Footprint" "kicad_file:PAD.03X.04" (at 0 0 0) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Datasheet" "" (at 0 0 0) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Description" "SparkFun Test Points\n\nBare copper test points for troubleshooting or In-Circuit-Testing. These are used by our Production team for verifying production